{"unit_id":"milu7__dsh-directory-plugin#card-zh","repo":"milu7/dsh-directory-plugin","commit":"b926c536850523453e7e40e4c892a987f9abae3d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"目录插件（DSH 插件，桌面端设置页与新建工作区流程）：让 Windows 上的 DSH 新建工作区时，从你设定的目录打开原生文件夹选择框。它在宿主注册配置与选择路由，并接入工作区目录选择槽位和设置页。主要功能包括设置默认起始目录、浏览选择目录、保存或恢复系统默认，以及在选择框失败时回到 DSH 内置选择器。适合希望新工作区从常用项目目录开始的 Windows 桌面端用户。需要 Windows 和 DSH 桌面端，不需要 API Key；插件在本机保存目录配置并写诊断日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:345","client/client.js:358","client/client.js:521","lib/core.js:103"]}
{"unit_id":"milu7__dsh-directory-plugin#card-en","repo":"milu7/dsh-directory-plugin","commit":"b926c536850523453e7e40e4c892a987f9abae3d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Directory Plugin (DSH desktop) makes the Windows new workspace folder chooser start in a directory you choose. Its settings page lets you browse, save, or reset that folder; the native picker can fall back to DSH's built-in picker. For Windows desktop users; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:345","client/client.js:358","client/client.js:521","lib/core.js:103"]}
