{"unit_id":"milu7__dsh-directory-plugin#feature-1","repo":"milu7/dsh-directory-plugin","commit":"b926c536850523453e7e40e4c892a987f9abae3d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"目录插件的功能「设置工作区起始目录」：为新建工作区选择框指定默认打开位置。在 DSH 设置页输入或浏览选择路径后点击保存，宿主将目录写入本机配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:429","client/client.js:450","lib/core.js:103"]}
